// Pong - 2-Player / AI Paddle Game
//
// Left paddle: W/S to move, Space to serve (Action1)
// Right paddle: AI ball-tracking (or Arrow keys / Enter in two-player)
// Goal sensors detect score and reset ball to center. First to 7 wins.
// Space / Enter restarts after game over.
//
